 *   <li>{@code $filter} - Filter expression (e.g., {@code status eq 'ACTIVE' and amount gt 1000})</li>
 *   <li>{@code $orderby} - Sort expression (e.g., {@code createdDate desc, name asc})</li>
 *   <li>{@code $top} - Maximum records to return (default: 50, max: 100)</li>
 *   <li>{@code $skip} - Number of records to skip (default: 0)</li>
 *   <li>{@code $select} - Comma-separated fields to include (e.g., {@code id,name,status})</li>
 *   <li>{@code $expand} - Comma-separated related entities to include (e.g., {@code orders,addresses})</li>
